---
/**
 * Transformer attention: spotlight on relevant words for “it”.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram diagram--anim">
  <figcaption class="diagram__caption">
    <span class="mono-label">Animation</span>
    Attention = which words matter for the next prediction
  </figcaption>
  <div class="diagram__frame">
    <svg
      class="diagram__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 620 220"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="attn-title attn-desc"
    >
      <title id="attn-title">Attention spotlight</title>
      <desc id="attn-desc">
        Sentence tokens appear in a row. A soft spotlight moves between trophy and suitcase while
        resolving the pronoun it, then settles on trophy.
      </desc>

      <rect x="12" y="16" width="596" height="188" rx="4" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--rule)" />

      <text class="diagram-hint" x="36" y="44" fill="var(--brand)">The trophy didn’t fit in the suitcase because it was too big.</text>

      <!-- tokens -->
      <g font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="15" fill="var(--ink)">
        <rect class="attn-token" x="40" y="70" width="70" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" />
        <text x="75" y="93" text-anchor="middle">trophy</text>

        <rect x="125" y="70" width="50" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-soft)" stroke="var(--rule)" />
        <text x="150" y="93" text-anchor="middle" opacity="0.7">fit</text>

        <rect class="attn-token attn-token--b" x="190" y="70" width="84" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-opacity="0.5" />
        <text x="232" y="93" text-anchor="middle">suitcase</text>

        <rect x="290" y="70" width="70" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-soft)" stroke="var(--rule)" />
        <text x="325" y="93" text-anchor="middle" opacity="0.7">because</text>

        <rect class="attn-focus" x="375" y="70" width="40" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="2" />
        <text x="395" y="93" text-anchor="middle">it</text>
      </g>

      <!-- spotlight beams -->
      <path class="attn-beam attn-beam--a" d="M395 106 L75 106" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity="0.45" fill="none" />
      <path class="attn-beam attn-beam--b" d="M395 106 L232 106" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.35" fill="none" />

      <text class="diagram-hint" x="36" y="160" fill="var(--ink)">Spotlight weight shifts — here “it” leans toward trophy more than suitcase.</text>
      <text class="diagram-hint" x="36" y="182" fill="var(--brand)">No equations — just “what should I focus on?”</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .attn-beam--a {
    stroke-dasharray: 6 8;
    animation: attn-flow 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .attn-beam--b {
    stroke-dasharray: 5 9;
    animation: attn-flow 2.8s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
  }
  .attn-token {
    animation: attn-glow 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .attn-token--b {
    animation-delay: 1.4s;
  }
  .attn-focus {
    animation: attn-focus 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes attn-flow {
    0%,
    100% {
      stroke-opacity: 0.25;
    }
    50% {
      stroke-opacity: 0.7;
    }
  }
  @keyframes attn-glow {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.75;
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  @keyframes attn-focus {
    0%,
    100% {
      stroke-opacity: 0.55;
    }
    50% {
      stroke-opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .attn-beam--a,
    .attn-beam--b,
    .attn-token,
    .attn-token--b,
    .attn-focus {
      animation: none !important;
    }
    .attn-beam--a,
    .attn-beam--b {
      stroke-dasharray: none;
      stroke-opacity: 0.45;
    }
  }
</style>
